Subject: SUMMARY: Altavista Forums
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=102653643321994

Thanks to Daniel Clar for letting me know it was possible.

My problem turned out to be an issue of ownership.

I had previously installed Netscape Fastrack under a user other than httpd, and =
set forums up that way as well.

The new "Compaq Secure Web" installed with httpd as the owner and that =
prevented forums from running correctly.

The fix:

I re-ran "./avf-configure -install_background" and gave it the httpd user.

Then I did a chown -R httpd on /usr/opt/altavista/forums and on my forums data =
dir.

Greg Freemyer
Internet Engineer
Deployment and Integration Specialist
The Norcross Group
www.NorcrossGroup.com

